    <h2>🔨 Build from Source</h2>
    <p>Prefer to build from source? Clone and compile TerraPDF yourself:</p>
    
    <pre><code class="language-bash">git clone https://github.com/sahebansari/TerraPDF.git
cd TerraPDF
dotnet build
dotnet test</code></pre>
    
    <h3>Requirements</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>.NET 8 SDK</strong> or later (includes .NET 9 SDK)</li>
      <li>Git for cloning the repository</li>
      <li>No other dependencies — TerraPDF is pure C#</li>
    </ul>
    
